    <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-top:8px;">
      <strong style="color:var(--danger)">Negative signals</strong> — Negative vocabulary is proportionally small (total ~400 mentions vs. 6,000+ positive), but "Bad" (117), "Issue" (76), and "Poor" (46) indicate a minority of products generating quality and reliability complaints. "Defective" and "Damage" point to fulfillment or quality-control gaps in specific SKUs.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══ SECTION 6: STRATEGIC RECOMMENDATIONS ════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section">
